values ('leopard-and-elephant-safaris', 'Leopard & Elephant Safaris', 'wildlife', 'Jeep safaris in Yala and the elephant parks of the north-central plains, planned around the seasons.', array['Sri Lanka packs remarkable wildlife into a small island. Yala is renowned for its leopards, while Minneriya and Kaudulla are famous for the elephant herds that gather on their reservoirs late in the dry season.', 'We choose parks according to the time of year and favour drivers who respect park rules and keep a proper distance from wildlife.']::text[], array['Early-morning or late-afternoon jeep safaris', 'Leopards, elephants, sloth bears, crocodiles and abundant birdlife', 'Choice of park depending on season and closures']::text[], array['Wildlife sightings are never guaranteed.', 'Parts of Yala have historically closed for several weeks late in the dry season.', 'Bring a hat, sun protection and binoculars if you have them.']::text[], 'Half day to 2 days', 'safariElephant', 1, true)
