values ('south-coast-and-whale-watching', 'South Coast & Whale Watching', 'beach', 'Beach time on the southern coast with optional seasonal whale-watching from Mirissa.', array['After the highlands, the south coast is the place to slow down. Choose between the lively crescent of Mirissa, the surf of Weligama or the quiet beaches of Tangalle.', 'In season, roughly November to April, boats from Mirissa head out in search of blue whales, sperm whales and dolphins. We recommend operators who follow responsible viewing guidelines.']::text[], array['Relaxed days on the beach with optional excursions', 'Morning whale-watching boat trip in season', 'Galle Fort and coastal villages nearby']::text[], array['Sea conditions can be rough; trips may be cancelled for safety.', 'Sightings depend on the season and are never guaranteed.']::text[], '2–5 days', 'mirissaShore', 4, true)
