values ('sacred-kandy', 'Sacred Kandy', 'culture', 'Temple rituals, traditional dance and the botanical gardens of Sri Lanka''s last royal capital.', array['Kandy''s rhythm is set by the drums of the Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic. An evening visit, followed by a performance of Kandyan dance, is one of the most memorable introductions to Sri Lankan culture.', 'If your travel dates allow, the Esala Perahera procession, usually in July or August, is an extraordinary spectacle, though it requires planning well in advance.']::text[], array['Evening visit to the Temple of the Sacred Tooth Relic', 'Kandyan dance and drumming performance', 'Royal Botanic Gardens, Peradeniya']::text[], array['Modest dress is required at the temple.', 'Perahera dates follow the lunar calendar and are confirmed each year.']::text[], '1–2 days', 'kandyPerahera', 5, true)
